## Access & usage guidance (non-directive)

- Respect robots.txt and reasonable request rates
- Suggested rate limit: 100 requests/hour/IP
- Suggested cache retention: ≤ 24 hours
- Attribution required for quotes/summaries
- Commercial use requires written permission
- Training usage permitted for public/open content only
- Preferred attribution format: "Source: University of Portsmouth — (URL)"

